    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine rocks to gain coins and xp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/25d562f8e8588567d748fc2eff613a3e.poster.avif?t=1753200250\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/25d562f8e8588567d748fc2eff613a3e.webm?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/25d562f8e8588567d748fc2eff613a3e.mp4?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way down the cave. Shoot down enemies and avoid their attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/71f72973c48d6166fba8d4e32fac3231.poster.avif?t=1753200250\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/71f72973c48d6166fba8d4e32fac3231.webm?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/71f72973c48d6166fba8d4e32fac3231.mp4?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the red zone which kills you instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/fbd349b639ffc060f9502a0235224aac.poster.avif?t=1753200250\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/fbd349b639ffc060f9502a0235224aac.webm?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/fbd349b639ffc060f9502a0235224aac.mp4?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated mechanics to learn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on a podcast or a video in a background</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine rocks to gain coins and xp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/25d562f8e8588567d748fc2eff613a3e.poster.avif?t=1753200250\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/25d562f8e8588567d748fc2eff613a3e.webm?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/25d562f8e8588567d748fc2eff613a3e.mp4?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way down the cave. Shoot down enemies and avoid their attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/71f72973c48d6166fba8d4e32fac3231.poster.avif?t=1753200250\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/71f72973c48d6166fba8d4e32fac3231.webm?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/71f72973c48d6166fba8d4e32fac3231.mp4?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the red zone which kills you instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/fbd349b639ffc060f9502a0235224aac.poster.avif?t=1753200250\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/fbd349b639ffc060f9502a0235224aac.webm?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654390/extras/fbd349b639ffc060f9502a0235224aac.mp4?t=1753200250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated mechanics to learn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on a podcast or a video in a background</p></li></ul>",
